{"id":"niedrig","lemma":"niedrig","pos":"adj","rank":4710,"glosses":["low"],"ipa":"/ˈniːdʁɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2a/De-niedrig.ogg/De-niedrig.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"niedriger","superlative":"am niedrigsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Es ist zu niedrig.","en":"It's too low.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/140599","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Das Dach ist sehr niedrig.","en":"The roof is very low.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"roof"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Der Stuhl ist mir zu niedrig.","en":"The chair is too low for me.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a chair"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Der Preis war niedriger, als ich gedacht hatte.","en":"The price was lower than I thought.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"price"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Dieser Stuhl ist für mich zu niedrig.","en":"This chair is too low for me.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"a chair"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to / too"},null]}]}